# NexTrade AI — environment template. Copy to .env (never commit .env).
# Phase A1 needs no secrets at all.
# Phase C (AI council) will add provider keys here, read only by the backend:
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# GEMINI_API_KEY=
# MT5: no password is ever stored. The adapter attaches to the MT5 terminal
# you logged into yourself.
